fireball to do more than 5 points of damage? You would then need to know exactly how much
damage a fireball is supposed to do at any given time. You would need a variable, or in this case
a parameter. Your new method could be written as follows:
int TakeDamageFromFireball(int damage)
{
int playerHealth = 100;
return playerHealth - damage;
